t="" width="512" height="512"/><div class="creator-profile-module__RUG2-a__pfMain"><div class="creator-profile-module__RUG2-a__nameLine" data-name-line=""><h1 class="creator-profile-module__RUG2-a__name" id="creator-name">하루</h1><span class="creator-head-module__tVKlha__fb " style="--fan:#C4B5FD;--on-fan:#111827" data-fandom-badge=""><span class="creator-head-module__tVKlha__fbMark" aria-hidden="true"><img src="http://127.0.0.1:55321/storage/v1/object/public/creator-photos/00000000-0000-4000-b000-000000000001/sym-1.webp" alt="" width="512" height="512"/></span>하루별</span></div><p class="creator-profile-module__RUG2-a__channel"><a class="channel-badge-icon-module__bsgO-G__link" href="https://chzzk.naver.com/417dc8350e35364743dfa51e34471396" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="치지직 채널 소유 확인" aria-label="치지직 채널 새 탭에서 열기 (치지직 채널 소유 확인)"><span class="creator-tag-module__84EBXa__badge creator-tag-module__84EBXa__app" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/brand/chzzk.png" alt="" width="20" height="20"/></span></a></p><div class="ctags creator-profile-module__RUG2-a__tags"><span class="tag tag--success creator-profile-module__RUG2-a__verified" title="치지직 채널 소유 확인"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 12.5 4.5 4.5L19 7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>채널 소유 확인</span><span class="ctag creator-tag-module__84EBXa__e3" style="--f:#E6FFF5;--k:#006B47"><span class="bd" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/brand/chzzk.png" alt="" width="24" height="24"/></span>치지직</span><span class="ctag creator-tag-module__84EBXa__e3" style="--f:#F2F2F3;--k:#343039"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 9.5C3 8.4 3.9 7.5 5 7.5h14c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v5c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2h-3.2c-.7 0-1.3-.4-1.7-1l-.7-1.2c-.5-.8-1.7-.8-2.2 0l-.7 1.2c-.4.6-1 1-1.7 1H5c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2z"></path></svg>버추얼</span></div><p class="creator-profile-module__RUG2-a__intro">게임 방송을 해요.</p><p class="creator-profile-module__RUG2-a__thanks">하루별 여러분의 마음 늘 감사해요</p></div><div class="creator-profile-module__RUG2-a__act"><a class="btn btn--wide" aria-label="하루님 팔로우하고 선물 보내기 — 로그인이 필요해요" href="/login">팔로우하고 선물 보내기</a></div><p class="creator-profile-module__RUG2-a__note">팔로우한 크리에이터에게만 보낼 수 있어요.</p></div></div></section><section class="creator-profile-module__RUG2-a__sec" aria-labelledby="state-h"><div class="pub-inner"><h2 class="sr-only" id="state-h">받는 상태와 요금</h2><div class="creator-profile-module__RUG2-a__infoGrid"><div class="card info ok"><span class="ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3a9 9 0 1 0 0 18 9 9 0 0 0 0-18zM8 12.5l3 3 5-6"></path></svg></span><h3>받는 상태</h3><p class="big">지금 선물을 받고 있어요</p></div><div class="card info"><span class="ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3a9 9 0 1 0 0 18 9 9 0 0 0 0-18zM12 7v5l3 2"></path></svg></span><h3>평균 승인 시간 (최근 30일)</h3><p class="big">약 2시간</p></div><div class="card info"><span class="ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3a9 9 0 1 0 0 18 9 9 0 0 0 0-18zM8 9l2 6 2-4 2 4 2-6"></path></svg></span><h3>상자마다 배송비 포함</h3><p class="big">6,900<!-- -->원부터</p></div><div class="card info"><span class="ic" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 20s-7-4.4-7-10a4 4 0 0 1 7-2.6A4 4 0 0 1 19 10c0 5.6-7 10-7 10z"></path></svg></span><p class="big">이번 달 <span class="accent">3<!-- -->명</span>의 팬이 마음을 보냈어요</p></div></div></div></section><section class="creator-profile-module__RUG2-a__sec" aria-label="보내기 전 안내"><div class="pub-inner"><div class="acc"><details><summary><span class="q"><b>보낼 수 없는 것</b></span><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m4 7.5 6 6 6-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></summary><div class="ans"><ul class="nos"><li><span class="x" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="m4 4 12 12M16 4 4 16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg></span><span>음식과 신선식품<span class="t-desc"> (<!-- -->유통기한이 있는 것은 모두 보낼 수 없어요.<!-- -->)</span></span></li><li><span class="x" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="m4 4 12 12M16 4 4 16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg></span><span>살아 있는 동물·동물 사체와 식물</span></li><li><span class="x" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="m4 4 12 12M16 4 4 16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg></span><span>폭발·인화성 물질 등 위험물<span class="t-desc"> (<!-- -->화약류·인화물질처럼 운송 중 위험한 물건은 보낼 수 없어요.<!-- -->)</span></span></li><li><span class="x" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="m4 4 12 12M16 4 4 16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg></span><span>현금·카드·상품권·유가증권<span class="t-desc"> (<!-- -->수표·어음처럼 현금으로 바꿀 수 있는 물건은 보낼 수 없어요.<!-- -->)</span></span></li><li><span class="x" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="m4 4 12 12M16 4 4 16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg></span><span>위법한 물건<span class="t-desc"> (<!-- -->밀수품·군수품처럼 허가받지 않았거나 법에 어긋나는 물건은 보낼 수 없어요.<!-- -->)</span></span></li><li><span class="x" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="m4 4 12 12M16 4 4 16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg></span><span>다시 만들 수 없는 서류<span class="t-desc"> (<!-- -->계약서·원고처럼 잃어버리면 되돌릴 수 없는 서류는 보낼 수 없어요.<!-- -->)</span></span></li><li><span class="x" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="m4 4 12 12M16 4 4 16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg></span><span>가액이 300만 원을 넘는 물건<span class="t-desc"> (<!-- -->한 상자에 든 물건 값이 300만 원을 넘으면 보낼 수 없어요.<!-- -->)</span></span></li></ul></div></details><details><summary><span class="q"><b>상자는 이렇게 확인해요</b></span><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m4 7.5 6 6 6-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></summary><div class="ans"><ol class="steps-ol"><li>모든 선물은 팬꾹에서 검수한 뒤 보냅니다.</li><li>탐지기 반응이 있으면 개봉 검수합니다.</li><li>승인 전까지 주소는 노출되지 않습니다.<!-- --> <!-- -->크리에이터 주소는 팬에게 공개되지 않습니다.</li></ol></div></details></div></div></section><section class="creator-profile-module__RUG2-a__sheet" aria-labelledby="send-h"><div class="pub-inner"><div class="creator-profile-module__RUG2-a__sheetIn"><img class="creator-profile-module__RUG2-a__pdeco creator-profile-module__RUG2-a__pdecoL" src="/img/icon-gift.png" width="96" height="96" alt="" aria-hidden="true"/><img class="creator-profile-module__RUG2-a__pdeco creator-profile-module__RUG2-a__pdecoR" src="/img/icon-truck.png" width="96" height="96" alt="" aria-hidden="true"/><div class="center-in"><h2 id="send-h"><span class="accent">선물 보내기</span></h2><a class="btn btn--wide" aria-label="하루님 팔로우하고 선물 보내기 — 로그인이 필요해요" href="/login">팔로우하고 선물 보내기</a></div></div></div></section><section class="creator-profile-module__RUG2-a__sec" aria-labelledby="similar-title"><div class="pub-inner"><div class="sec-head head-row creator-profile-module__RUG2-a__head"><h2 id="similar-title">이런 크리에이터도 있어요</h2><a class="more-link" href="/creators">전체 보기</a></div><ul class="creator-profile-module__RUG2-a__otherGrid"><li><a class="creator-profile-module__RUG2-a__other" aria-label="모모님의 선물 링크 페이지" href="/creators/00000000-0000-4000-b000-000000000002"><svg class="face face--sm" viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="24" cy="24" r="24" fill="var(--face-3)"></circle><circle cx="17" cy="22" r="2.6" fill="var(--ink)"></circle><circle cx="31" cy="22" r="2.6" fill="var(--ink)"></circle><path d="M18 29c2.5 3.5 9.5 3.5 12